    {
      "track_id": "zh-CN-mandarin",
      "code": "zh-CN",
      "language": "汉语",
      "variant": "普通话",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "老鹰会往南飞吗",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "爸爸，我今天看到老鹰了，楼上看到一只老鹰在天上飞。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就一只？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是啊！飞走了我就看不见了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "回去我要查一下，老鹰会不会往南飞？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "大雁就会往南飞。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我们没有看过燕子。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "大雁不是燕子。雁跟燕不是一回事。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
      "code": "es-ES",
      "language": "西班牙语",
      "variant": "西班牙本土西语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "¿Las águilas vuelan hacia el sur?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_title_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:34+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Papá, hoy he visto un águila. La vi volando en el cielo cuando estaba en el piso de arriba.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:37+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Solo una?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:38+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¡Sí! Luego se fue volando y ya no pude verla.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Cuando lleguemos a casa, voy a buscar si las águilas vuelan hacia el sur.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:42+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Los gansos salvajes sí vuelan hacia el sur.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:43+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Nunca hemos visto golondrinas.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Los «da yan» (gansos salvajes) no son «yan zi» (golondrinas). «Yan» (ganso salvaje) y «yan» (golondrina) no son lo mismo.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_007_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:52:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Les aigles volent-ils vers le sud ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Papa, j'ai vu un aigle aujourd'hui. Je l'ai vu voler dans le ciel quand j'étais à l'étage.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:43+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Un seul ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:43+08:00",
          "generation": null,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father",
          "metadata_source": "existing_mp3"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Oui ! Puis il s'est envolé et je ne le voyais plus.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:46+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "En rentrant, je vais vérifier si les aigles volent vers le sud.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:49+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Les oies sauvages, elles, volent vers le sud.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:49+08:00",
          "generation": null,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father",
          "metadata_source": "existing_mp3"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Nous n'avons jamais vu d'hirondelles.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:54:52+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Les « da yan » (oies sauvages) ne sont pas des « yan zi » (hirondelles). « Yan » (oie sauvage) et « yan » (hirondelle), ce n'est pas la même chose.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-24-do-eagles-fly-south_dialogue_007_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
